WEBVTT

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.460
Zerk eragozten zidan baina?

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:33.830
Konturatu nintzen

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.760
aldebiko irtenbidea aurkeztu zidatela.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:37.980
Bietako bat:

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.180
haragijalea zara,

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.300
ala begetarianoa.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.310
Eta uste dut orduan
ez nengoela guztiz prest.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:45.776
Imajinatu:

00:01:46.496 --> 00:01:47.823
zure azken hanburgesa.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:52.280
(Barreak)

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:53.770
Zentzua

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:55.780
eta nire borondate ona

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:59.310
dastamen-papilen arerio nituen.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.470
"Gerora" egingo nuela hitzeman nuen,